1509
01:04:44,950 --> 01:04:46,952
-They woke up
The Oak Ridge Boys.

1510
01:04:46,986 --> 01:04:49,955
-♪ Elvira, giddy up

1511
01:04:49,989 --> 01:04:53,890
[Thudding, whirring]

1512
01:05:01,863 --> 01:05:03,727
-Oh, say, that's a nice one,

1513
01:05:03,761 --> 01:05:04,935
hmm, wrought iron
-Hey, Servo...

1514
