1539
01:05:53,432 --> 01:05:55,261
-What? What?
-Okay, 1 hour? I mean it.

1540
01:05:55,296 --> 01:05:56,849
All right?
-Oh, for crying out loud...

1541
01:05:56,883 --> 01:05:58,816
-Ow, oh, ow, ah!

1542
01:05:58,851 --> 01:06:00,542
-Yeah, Mike,
I forgot to tell you

1543
