1573
01:07:15,272 --> 01:07:16,480
-As you please, Dave.

1574
01:07:16,515 --> 01:07:18,551
-But thank you.
-You're welcome.

1575
01:07:18,586 --> 01:07:20,174
-Lea, you stay here.

1576
01:07:20,208 --> 01:07:22,935
Commander.

1577
01:07:22,969 --> 01:07:26,766
-There goes a big, brave
brick of meat.

1578
01:07:26,801 --> 01:07:28,389
