indefinitely and have a beer.

1584
01:07:45,199 --> 01:07:46,924
-Geez.
-We're going in.

1585
01:07:46,959 --> 01:07:49,617
-I clogged up the toilet,
but we're going in.

1586
01:07:49,651 --> 01:07:51,170
-Oh, now they stole
the Enterprise's

1587
01:07:51,205 --> 01:07:53,793
