the pan-seared tuna, you guys.

1589
01:07:55,761 --> 01:07:57,245
Chef says we're all out.

1590
01:07:57,280 --> 01:08:01,387
-Oh, I'm going to miss
this old, uh, wherever we are.

1591
01:08:04,149 --> 01:08:06,116
-Don't get smart
with me, ceiling.

1592
01:08:09,499 --> 01:08:12,191
-Touch Rustrod.
-Reef Blastbody.

1593
01:08:12,226 --> 01:08:16,920
