1601
01:08:33,454 --> 01:08:35,180
-Big McLargeHuge.

1602
01:08:35,214 --> 01:08:37,837
-Damn you.

1603
01:08:37,872 --> 01:08:38,907
-So where the hell
are these two

1604
01:08:38,942 --> 01:08:40,219
in relationship to each other?

1605
01:08:40,254 --> 01:08:42,118
I don't...
-Sneaky little...

1606
