1609
01:08:48,986 --> 01:08:50,747
Commander Ryder,we're being attacked from above.

1610
01:08:50,781 --> 01:08:52,921
The Enforcers are... Ah!

1611
01:08:52,956 --> 01:08:54,406
-Hold on.
Let me come down and tell you.

1612
01:08:54,440 --> 01:08:55,614
Right there.

1613
01:08:55,648 --> 01:08:57,754
-Ah!

1614
01:08:57,788 --> 01:09:02,172
