1622
01:09:23,745 --> 01:09:25,954
-Well, loading up
some railing fodder here.

1623
01:09:25,989 --> 01:09:28,405
-All right.

1624
01:09:28,440 --> 01:09:30,131
-Well, my flamethrower
is kind of weak here.

1625
01:09:30,166 --> 01:09:31,546
It's...

1626
01:09:31,581 --> 01:09:36,931
[Imitating soundtrack]

1627
01:09:36,965 --> 01:09:38,208
-Let's go, go, go.

1628
01:09:38,243 --> 01:09:39,658
-You know, in this movie,
people don't seem to trust

1629
