1657
01:11:02,672 --> 01:11:05,813
-Please don't use those stairs.

1658
01:11:05,847 --> 01:11:07,193
-Ah!
-Ah!

1659
01:11:07,228 --> 01:11:08,402
-Oh, please don't shoot us.

1660
01:11:08,436 --> 01:11:11,025
Okay, then you don't get
a boxed lunch then.

1661
01:11:11,059 --> 01:11:14,062
-Ah!

1662
01:11:14,097 --> 01:11:16,306
-You know, it has to be noted

1663
01:11:16,341 --> 01:11:18,653
