1672
01:11:43,091 --> 01:11:45,301
-Ah!
-Ooh, he needs a giant tux.

1673
01:11:45,335 --> 01:11:47,993
-Out of my way, you idiot!
-Stupid Buddhist monk,

1674
01:11:48,027 --> 01:11:50,444
the Vietnam war has been over
for hundreds of years.

1675
01:11:52,963 --> 01:11:54,793
-Well, if there's one thing
this movie does well,

1676
01:11:54,827 --> 01:11:56,346
