1677
01:11:56,381 --> 01:11:58,175
-I mean, Canadians?
-Oh, come on, Mike.

1678
01:11:58,210 --> 01:12:01,040
This movie is ripe
with the stench of back bacon.

1679
01:12:01,075 --> 01:12:03,353
Geez.
-If you say so.

1680
01:12:03,388 --> 01:12:06,322
-Wow, I am on the edge
of my seat.

1681
01:12:06,356 --> 01:12:07,633
I should probably scoot back
a little.

1682
01:12:07,668 --> 01:12:09,117
It'd be more comfortable.
-Yeah, you've got

1683
01:12:09,152 --> 01:12:11,223
