golf-ball sized throat nodes?

1696
01:12:47,570 --> 01:12:50,158
Or...

1697
01:12:50,193 --> 01:12:51,470
-Oh, watch the groin.

1698
01:12:51,505 --> 01:12:53,196
Ow, watch the groin.

1699
01:12:53,230 --> 01:12:55,267
-It seems to me that randomly
blowing up things

1700
