1702
01:13:03,448 --> 01:13:05,415
-Fire.

1703
01:13:05,450 --> 01:13:07,486
-Don't waste your time.
You'll never get through there.

1704
01:13:07,521 --> 01:13:09,799
-I must say.
-You'll get singed.

1705
01:13:09,833 --> 01:13:12,560
It's over.
Now let's get out of here.

1706
01:13:12,595 --> 01:13:16,702
-We're being totally defeated,
I must say.

1707
01:13:16,737 --> 01:13:19,049
-Eat Punchbeef.

1708
01:13:19,084 --> 01:13:20,913
-I'm leaving.
-Lea.

1709
01:13:20,948 --> 01:13:22,363
-You mind getting
me some coffee?

1710
01:13:22,398 --> 01:13:23,640
-Lea.
-Get me some coffee.

1711
01:13:23,675 --> 01:13:26,885
-Lea, come back.
-Forget it, Devie.

1712
01:13:26,919 --> 01:13:29,612
