-You can't stop love.

1713
01:13:33,132 --> 01:13:35,928
-He must have blown out his
knee in an earlier mutiny.

1714
01:13:40,657 --> 01:13:44,074
-Oh, this is new. -It says in the Bellerian book,

1715
01:13:44,109 --> 01:13:46,974
